Differences from the provisional plan sketch: the STFT conv output is
258 channels as sketched, but the reflect pad is 64 on the RIGHT of a
576-sample (context ++ window) input — the 64-sample context is
maintained OUTSIDE the graph by the caller (utils_vad.py OnnxWrapper),
not by the pad. Everything else (conv stack, ReLUs, LSTM 128,
sigmoid head) matches the sketch shapes after the dump pinned the
strides/pads recorded above.

